The B23R Zombie game mode is a free event in  Call of Duty. It came with the  B23 R Zombies  pack.
Players can choose between two game modes:  Z.O.E (Zombie Operated Environment), Z.R.V. or Zombie Run Variant (ZR-V). They are available in any game type and season. In some multiplayer events an attempt has been made to limit players in certain game modes and with certain perks. These limits are as described:
• Unlimited Health, Ammo and Weapons;
• No weapon customization;
• Cannot have equipment in inventory or on character after entering 1st round;
• Unable to purchase weapon attachments (except laser sights) at any time;
• Must complete a full round (2 rounds) with no respind; and;
·  No unlocks (except for one random unlock per night during event)
•  Players are unable to equip 2nd or higher class perks, nor will any perk available within a perk
